export anchor VampireStyle:
    number: 285
    screen: CodeRepository
    name: Vampire
    idea: A dark purple bento board where every tile is labelled like a code comment, the title reads like a keyword, labels are string tokens, and pink, green and cyan carry the syntax colours of the whole page.
    base: dark
    palette:
        crypt: #1d1928, the page background and the diff code area
        velvet: #272235, tiles and the style sheet cards
        dusk: #342d48, chips, fields, hunk header and the disabled merge button
        seam: #4d4468, tile borders and dividers
        moon: #f5f2fb, text
        haze: #bbb2d4, meta and line numbers
        pink: #ff79c6, keywords, the title number, the primary button, the current tab and focus
        cyan: #8be9fd, links, owner name and JSX tags
        violet: #c6a8ff, comment style tile labels and attribute names
        green: #5af78e, passed, approved, added lines and function names
        lemon: #f1fa8c, requested changes and strings
        blood: #ff6e6e, failing and removed lines
        addTint: #1f3329, added line rows
        delTint: #3d1f2c, removed line rows
    type:
        System sans, system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, for prose at 15px on 1.5,
        and a monospace stack, ui-monospace, Cascadia Code, JetBrains Mono, Menlo,
        Consolas, for every label, token, number and code line. Title 30px at 700
        with the number 214 in pink mono. Tile labels are 13px mono lowercase
        written as // checks in violet.
    layout:
        A 1200px bento grid of twelve columns. A slim top bar shows the owner in
        cyan, a slash and the repository name in pink, a Private token, and Watch
        12, Star 48 and Fork 3 written as small call style chips. Tabs sit beneath
        as a flat row with a 3px pink bar under Pull requests. The first tile spans
        the width and holds the title, the Open chip, the merge sentence with branch
        tokens, and the labels as quoted string tokens. The second row has three
        tiles, checks with a twelve segment donut and 11 of 12 in the middle,
        reviewers, and details with assignees, milestone, linked issue and the
        disabled merge button. The third row has a four column files tile and an
        eight column diff tile with syntax colours and the inline comment. Below
        980px tiles take half or full width, below 640px all stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 16px gaps between tiles, 24px tile padding, 8px between tokens.
    density: Medium. Many small tiles, each with one job.
    corners: Rounded. 16px tiles, 10px buttons and fields, 999px tokens.
    borders: 1px seam border on every tile. The comment and the hunk header have a 3px pink left edge.
    shadows: A soft 0 8px 24px black shadow under tiles and a faint pink glow under the primary button.
    icons:
        Line icons at 2px stroke sized at 1.1em in the colour of their word. Check
        circle for passed and approved, crossed square for failing, triangle with a
        bang for requested changes, padlock for the blocked merge.
    focus: A 2px pink outline offset 2px with a 6px soft pink glow.
    tone: Playful developer voice in labels, such as // checks and // reviewers, plain sentences in content.
